-- bytea). The hashed column lists are the _hashcols literals shared by
-- apply.sql, rollback.sql, recover-before-image.sql and verify.sql —
-- volatile bookkeeping columns (version, updated_at, notification
-- is_read/read_at, AdminAudit createdAt) are deliberately absent.
